| description = The Jaevins school of magic is where young magicians in Erudin go to practice their art under the guidance of Guildmaster Markus Jaevins.  Located in the Erudin Palace in the Gatecallers hall, [[Magician]]s of all ages study their art.  The Gatecallers support the [[High Council of Erudin]] and the [[High Guard of Erudin]].  Like most every guild in Erudin they oppose the [[Heretics]] of Paineel.

